	"name": "Loose the Dogs of War",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/creatures/mammals/wolf-shadow-black.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 15th, level your devotion to the cause of war allows you to take on greater power than ever before. You may now expend your channel divinity to empower yourself as a champion of war, gaining the following benefits for 1 minute:</p><ul><li><p>You gain expertise on Athletics checks</p></li><li><p>When you make a melee weapon attack, your target takes fire damage equal to your Charisma modifier whether you hit or miss.</p></li><li><p>When you successfully hit a target with a combat maneuver, you may force them to make a Strength save or be pushed back 10ft, 5ft on a successful save.</p></li><li><p>You critically hit on a 19-20.</p></li></ul>",
